  "items": {
   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT in relation to authorizing Hamaspik of Rockland County, Inc. to file\nwith the town of Ramapo assessor an application for certain real property tax\nexemptions",
    "basePrintNo": "S8606",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8606-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Real Property Taxation",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S8606\n\nSPONSOR: CARLUCCI\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act in relation to authorizing Hamaspik of Rockland County, Inc. to\nfile with the town of Ramapo assessor an application for certain real\nproperty tax exemptions\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo authorize Hamaspik of Rockland County, Inc., located in the town of\nMonsey to apply for a real property tax exemption for certain property\nin the Town of Ramapo, county of Rockland.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 authorizes the Town of Ramapo, county of Rockland, to accept\nfrom Hamaspik of Rockland County, Inc., an application for exemption\nfrom real property taxes.\n\nSection 2 provides for an immediate effective date. JUSTIFICATION:\nHamaspik of Rockland County, Inc. operates as a non-profit organization.\nThe Organization offers community habilitation, housing, family support,\nday programs, and hospice care services.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATION:  None\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediate.\n",
